{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161450/extras/b513da573c570651b41c9adb1e6f7d06.poster.avif?t=1773243997\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161450/extras/b513da573c570651b41c9adb1e6f7d06.webm?t=1773243997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161450/extras/b513da573c570651b41c9adb1e6f7d06.mp4?t=1773243997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Simple Controls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mastering Blade Blitz is a breeze with intuitive controls. A joystick and two buttons are all you need to start slicing and dicing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161450/extras/a5ab2a7986915b71eca7cbf0b5bf7e93.poster.avif?t=1773243997\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161450/extras/a5ab2a7986915b71eca7cbf0b5bf7e93.webm?t=1773243997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161450/extras/a5ab2a7986915b71eca7cbf0b5bf7e93.mp4?t=1773243997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Couch Competitive Multiplayer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blade Blitz is a frenzy for up to six players, perfect for local multiplayer fun with friends. Enjoy short, sharp rounds of chaotic action. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161450/extras/4f64a7435930189907d59f1135283a70.poster.avif?t=1773243997\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161450/extras/4f64a7435930189907d59f1135283a70.webm?t=1773243997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161450/extras/4f64a7435930189907d59f1135283a70.mp4?t=1773243997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Arenas</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle it out in unique arenas, each offering its own edge-of-your-seat challenges.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161450/extras/a91c54ad0082096d1be7447ce535a2bf.poster.avif?t=1773243997\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161450/extras/a91c54ad0082096d1be7447ce535a2bf.webm?t=1773243997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161450/extras/a91c54ad0082096d1be7447ce535a2bf.mp4?t=1773243997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Join Forces</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with a friend in 1v1 to 3v3 team battles. Or, if you prefer a solo adventure, test your blade against AI opponents. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Notes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We support a wide range of controllers, including Xbox, PlayStation, Switch, and many more.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Match","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3161450/87273001f46e6ae49320a1db4fe3487f516b2de7.jpg"},{"name":"Quick Learner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3161450/8e98b9